--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

THE COMMA ZONES ARE SIXTEEN COLUMNS WIDE, SO EIGHTY COLUMNS GIVE FIVE:

N               N*N             SQR N           1/N             N!
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1               1               1               1               1
2               4               1.41421356      .5              2
3               9               1.73205081      .333333333      6
4               16              2               .25             24
5               25              2.23606798      .2              120
6               36              2.44948974      .166666667      720
7               49              2.64575131      .142857143      5040
8               64              2.82842712      .125            40320
9               81              3               .111111111      362880
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

AND THE WRAP MOVES WITH IT - THIS LINE IS EXACTLY EIGHTY CHARACTERS LONG.....|WR
APPED

PR#0 PUTS IT BACK TO FORTY.

